    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "LEXEDITOR now uses two display-only origin icons instead of the star: a steel-blue globe for Red Dead Online records and a brass pen nib for locally created records. All 42 existing local-only items are seeded, including older non-LEX brass provisions, and future items or effects created in LEXEDITOR register their custom origin automatically. To check it, open Items and compare Improved Bow (globe), Gunpowder or Ring Brass (pen nib), and Cattleman (no icon); hover each icon for its origin text.",
